E0005 (https://starstream.nightstream.dev/errors/E0005)

  x unary `-` expects a signed integer type but found `u8`
   ,-[test.star:2:6]
 1 | fn test() -> u8 {
 2 |     -1
   :      |
   :      `-- cannot negate unsigned type `u8`
 3 | }
